### DataModelGov RESTful API 调用示例
### 除了ApiGenerationController之外的4个Controller的所有方法

@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080
@contentType = application/json

### ==================== 关联规则配置 (AssociationRulesController) ====================

### 1. 创建关联规则
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/association/rules/save
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "name": "用户行为关联规则",
  "description": "分析用户购买行为关联性",
  "tableName": "user_behavior",
  "modelName": "purchase_prediction",
  "modelVersion": "1.0.0",
  "status": true,
  "inputsBind": "{\"age\": \"int\", \"income\": \"double\", \"gender\": \"string\"}",
  "outputsBind": "{\"purchase_probability\": \"double\", \"recommendation\": \"string\"}"
}

### 2. 分页查询关联规则
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/association/rules/query
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "pageNum": 1,
  "pageSize": 10,
  "name": "用户行为",
  "status": "active"
}

### 3. 查询关联规则总数
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/association/rules/count
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "name": "用户行为",
  "status": "active"
}

### 4. 关联规则详情
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/association/rules/detail?createTime=1640995200000

### 5. 删除关联规则
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/association/rules/delete?createTime=1640995200000

### ==================== 数据资源管理 (DataSourceController) ====================

### 1. 注册IoTDB数据源
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/datasource/register
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "storageEngineType": 1,
  "ip": "127.0.0.1",
  "port": 6667,
  "hasData": false,
  "isReadOnly": false,
  "username": "root",
  "password": "root",
  "sessionPoolSize": 130
}

### 2. 注册InfluxDB数据源
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/datasource/register
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "storageEngineType": 2,
  "ip": "127.0.0.1",
  "port": 8086,
  "hasData": false,
  "isReadOnly": false,
  "url": "http://localhost:8086/",
  "username": "admin",
  "password": "12345678",
  "token": "influxdb-token",
  "organization": "sensor-org"
}

### 3. 注册文件系统数据源
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/datasource/register
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "storageEngineType": 3,
  "ip": "127.0.0.1",
  "port": 6667,
  "hasData": false,
  "isReadOnly": false,
  "iginxPort": 6888,
  "dir": "/data/iginx",
  "dataStruct": "LegacyParquet",
  "dummyStruct": "LegacyFilesystem",
  "clientSocketTimeout": 30000,
  "clientConnectTimeout": 10000,
  "clientConnectPoolMaxTotal": 8
}

### 4. 注册关系数据库数据源
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/datasource/register
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "storageEngineType": 4,
  "ip": "127.0.0.1",
  "port": 3306,
  "hasData": false,
  "isReadOnly": false,
  "engine": "postgresql",
  "username": "postgres",
  "password": "postgres",
  "connectionTimeout": 30000,
  "idleTimeout": 10000,
  "maximumPoolSize": 20,
  "minimumIdle": 1,
  "leakDetectionThreshold": 2500,
  "prepStmtCacheSize": 250,
  "prepStmtCacheSqlLimit": 2048
}

### 5. 注册MongoDB数据源
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/datasource/register
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "storageEngineType": 5,
  "ip": "127.0.0.1",
  "port": 27017,
  "hasData": false,
  "isReadOnly": false,
  "uri": "mongodb://localhost:27017/datamodelgov",
  "schemaSampleSize": 1000,
  "dummySampleSize": 0
}

### 6. 注册Redis数据源
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/datasource/register
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "storageEngineType": 6,
  "ip": "127.0.0.1",
  "port": 6379,
  "hasData": false,
  "isReadOnly": false,
  "username": "redis_user",
  "password": "redis_password",
  "timeout": 2000
}

### 7. 移除数据源
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/datasource/remove
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "id": 1,
  "ip": "127.0.0.1",
  "port": 6667,
  "type": 1,
  "schemaPrefix": "",
  "dataPrefix": ""
}

### 8. 数据资源列表
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/datasource/list

### 9. 数据资源树
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/datasource/tree

### ==================== 数据查询与管理 (DataTableController) ====================

### 1. 数据查询
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/data/query
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "paths": ["root.sg1.temperature", "root.sg1.humidity"],
  "startTime": 1640995200000,
  "endTime": 1641081600000,
  "aggregateType": 2,
  "precision": 3600000,
  "timePrecision": 4
}

### 2. 导入数据 (multipart/form-data)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/data/import
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=----WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW

------WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="config"; Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "targetPath": "root.sg.sensor_data"
}
------WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="sensor_data.csv"
Content-Type: text/csv

timestamp,device_id,temperature,humidity
1640995200000,device001,25.5,60.2
1640995260000,device002,26.1,58.9
1640995320000,device003,24.8,62.1
------WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW--

### 3. 导出数据
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/data/export
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "paths": ["root.sg1.temperature", "root.sg1.humidity"],
  "startTime": 1640995200000,
  "endTime": 1641081600000,
  "aggregateType": 2,
  "precision": 3600000,
  "timePrecision": 4
}

### 4. 数据删除
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/data/delete
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "paths": ["root.sg1.temperature", "root.sg1.humidity"],
  "startTime": 1640995200000,
  "endTime": 1641081600000
}

### 5. 关系数据查询
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/data/relational/query
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "pageNum": 1,
  "pageSize": 10,
  "tableName": "user_orders",
  "sortField": "create_time",
  "sortDirection": "DESC",
  "filters": [
    {
      "field": "amount",
      "operator": ">",
      "value": "1000",
      "startGroup": true,
      "endGroup": true
    }
  ]
}

### 6. 关系数据总量查询
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/data/relational/count
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "pageNum": 1,
  "pageSize": 10,
  "tableName": "user_orders",
  "filters": [
    {
      "field": "amount",
      "operator": ">",
      "value": "1000",
      "startGroup": true,
      "endGroup": true
    }
  ]
}

### 7. 关系数据Excel导出
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/data/relational/export
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "pageNum": 1,
  "pageSize": 10,
  "tableName": "user_orders",
  "sortField": "create_time",
  "sortDirection": "DESC",
  "filters": [
    {
      "field": "create_time",
      "operator": ">=",
      "value": "2023-01-01"
    }
  ]
}

### ==================== 模型资产管理 (ModelFileController) ====================

### 1. 上传模型 (multipart/form-data)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/model/upload
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=----WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW

------WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="user_model.json"
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "modelType": "classification",
  "features": ["age", "income", "education"],
  "target": "purchase_decision",
  "algorithm": "random_forest",
  "accuracy": 0.85
}
------WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="name"
Content-Type: text/plain

用户购买预测模型
------WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="version"
Content-Type: text/plain

1.0.0
------WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW--

### 2. 下载模型
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/model/download
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

name=用户购买预测模型&version=1.0.0&fileName=user_model_v1.json

### 3. 模型元数据详情
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/model/metas?name=用户购买预测模型&version=1.0.0

### 4. 保存模型元数据
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/model/metas
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "name": "用户购买预测模型",
  "version": "1.0.0",
  "fileName": "user_model_v1.json",
  "author": "data_scientist_001",
  "scene": "电商推荐",
  "inputs": "{\"age\": \"int\", \"income\": \"double\", \"gender\": \"string\"}",
  "outputs": "{\"purchase_probability\": \"double\", \"recommendation\": \"string\"}",
  "timestamp": 1640995200000
}

### 5. 模型元数据历史
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/model/history?name=用户购买预测模型

### 6. 移除模型资产 (删除指定版本)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/model/delete?name=用户购买预测模型&version=1.0.0

### 7. 移除模型资产 (删除所有版本)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/model/delete?name=用户购买预测模型

### ==================== 测试和验证 ====================

### 健康检查
GET {{baseUrl}}/actuator/health

### 应用信息
GET {{baseUrl}}/actuator/info

### Swagger文档
GET {{baseUrl}}/swagger-ui.html

### ==================== 说明 ====================

### Controller说明：
# 1. AssociationRulesController - 关联规则配置 (/api/association)
#    - 创建关联规则
#    - 分页查询关联规则  
#    - 查询关联规则总数
#    - 关联规则详情
#    - 删除关联规则

# 2. DataSourceController - 数据资源管理 (/api/datasource)
#    - 注册异构数据源 (支持6种类型：IoTDB, InfluxDB, 文件系统, 关系数据库, MongoDB, Redis)
#    - 移除异构数据源
#    - 数据资源列表
#    - 数据资源树

# 3. DataTableController - 数据查询与管理 (/api/data)
#    - 数据查询
#    - 导入数据 (支持文件上传)
#    - 导出数据
#    - 数据删除
#    - 关系数据查询 (支持表连接)
#    - 关系数据总量查询
#    - 关系数据Excel导出

# 4. ModelFileController - 模型资产管理 (/api/model)
#    - 上传模型 (支持文件上传)
#    - 下载模型
#    - 模型元数据详情
#    - 保存模型元数据
#    - 模型元数据历史
#    - 移除模型资产

### 数据源类型说明：
# 1 - IoTDB (时序数据库)
# 2 - InfluxDB (时序数据库)
# 3 - 文件系统
# 4 - 关系数据库 (MySQL, PostgreSQL等)
# 5 - MongoDB (文档数据库)
# 6 - Redis (缓存数据库)

### 使用说明：
# 1. 修改 @baseUrl 变量为实际的服务地址
# 2. 根据实际环境修改连接参数 (IP, 端口, 用户名, 密码等)
# 3. 文件上传接口需要使用 multipart/form-data 格式
# 4. 导出接口会返回文件流，需要特殊处理
# 5. 所有POST请求体都是JSON格式
# 6. 查询条件支持多种操作符：>, >=, <, <=, =, !=, LIKE, IN等
